   ],
   "combo_choices": []
  },
  {
   "id": 329757,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Use an eulerization of the graph you found to determine the fewest borders that must be covered twice in order to cross each border at least once and return to the state in which you started. Explain your reasoning.",
